// Title: Remote Access Tool - RURAT Execution From Unusual Location
// ID: e01fa958-6893-41d4-ae03-182477c5e77d
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-19
// Tags: attack.stealth
// Description: Detects execution of Remote Utilities RAT (RURAT) from an unusual location (outside of 'C:\Program Files')
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((ImageFileName = /.*\\rutserv.exe/i or ImageFileName = /.*\\rfusclient.exe/i)) or (Product = "Remote Utilities")) and not(((ImageFileName = /C:\\Program Files\\Remote Utilities.*/i or ImageFileName = /C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Remote Utilities.*/i))))
